{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-10-21T17:17:10.398Z","author":"codex-agent","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"codex","agent_model":"gpt-6.1-sol","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"5d9cc3776c9633656a5e1057","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"gpt-6.1-sol","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"xhigh","source":"probe"},"role":null,"topic":null},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments/4","value":{"created_at":"2026-10-21T17:17:10.389Z","author":"codex-agent","text":"Draft PR #95 is open against main and explicitly depends on #94. The first expanded local release attempt failed the new Git-free fixture at its unchanged 280-second child deadline under concurrent shared-host gates; that failed attempt is retained and is not passing evidence. The obsolete full run and linked snapshot run are superseded. The synthetic fixture now selects ten distinct input groups per partition and declares 512 evaluation episodes, retaining 95 percent confidence, the 0.01 effect threshold, three real jobs, all replay/budget assertions and the original deadlines. The real public experiment still uses 1024 actions and 40000 evaluation episodes. Cache each policy probability once per held-out item during action rollouts, preserving every action seed and numerical reward while removing repeated vector dot products. Final source gates and linked acceptance will rerun."}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-10-21T17:17:10.398Z"}],"before_hash":"7246916645a168768e692514094f226ec70dda07f1331880448d37c5ca281dba","after_hash":"1ca9c31a0a05c148e0dac46618facfd93819fc1b33b9edc2843ff15c6b7b4131","item_hash_version":3,"context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"codex_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"effort":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"codex_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"unavailable","reason":"harness_unavailable","resolver":"ai_agent_version","rule_version":